sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Harness
  participant I as Ingress
  participant A as Client Auth
  participant R as Route Resolver
  participant C as Credential Selector
  participant U as Upstream
  participant O as Observability
  H->>I: HTTP request + Gateway Client Key
  I->>I: 识别入口协议并生成 gateway_request_id
  I->>A: 认证 Header
  A-->>I: GatewayClient + HarnessProfile
  I->>R: protocol + requested_model + client context
  R-->>I: RouteRule + RouteTarget snapshot
  I->>C: endpoint + account policy
  C-->>I: selected Credential snapshot
  I->>O: create Request + Attempt
  I->>U: 同协议请求（改鉴权、URL、model、显式 patch）
  alt 非流式
    U-->>I: HTTP response
    I-->>H: status/body/allowed headers
  else SSE 流式
    U-->>I: raw SSE bytes
    I-->>H: byte-transparent stream
    I->>O: side-channel event/usage parsing
  end
  I->>O: complete Attempt and Request
